/*
 * Operator Precedence
 * ====================
 * priority  associativity  operators
 * ----------------------------------
 *   10     left            include, include_once, eval, require, require_once
 *   20     left            ,
 *   30     left            or
 *   40     left            xor
 *   50     left            and
 *   60     right           print
 *   70     right           yield
 *   80     right           =>
 *   85     right           yield from
 *   90     right           = += -= *= /= .= %= &= |= ^= <<= >>= **=
 *  100     left            ? :
 *  110     right           ??
 *  120     left            ||
 *  130     left            &&
 *  140     left            |
 *  150     left            ^
 *  160     left            &
 *  170     non-associative == != === !==
 *  180     non-associative < <= > >= <=>
 *  185     left            .
 *  190     left            << >>
 *  200     left            + -
 *  210     left            * / %
 *  220     right           !
 *  230     non-associative instanceof
 *  240     right           + - ++ -- ~ (type) @
 *  250     right           **
 *  260     left            [
 *  270     non-associative clone new
